{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>在西班牙語中，「sobremesa」指飯後留在餐桌閒聊的時光。這款 App 專為重現此傳統而設，透過提供各種話題與遊戲，讓家庭成員放下手機，專注於面對面的交流。它適合所有年齡層，能輕鬆促進親子關係或朋友間的互動，目前限時免費下載。</p>\n\n<h2>豐富話題激發對話</h2>\n<p>內置數百個手寫提示，涵蓋開放式問題、二選一挑戰、冷知識、益智謎題及即時活動等八種主題。無須註冊或連線，完全離線運作且無廣告干擾。免費版提供四十道初始問題及每日三道更新，設計簡潔易於傳遞，讓對話自然展開，無贏家亦無分數壓力，純粹享受相聚時刻。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-724-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-725-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-726-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-727-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-728-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-729-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sobremesa: Dinner Questions</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T13:38:14.338549+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}